#X text 30 650 LIVE SerialOSC Grid workbench. Load starts discovery and both callback transports only.;
#X text 30 680 Slot A and B each require selection then probe then claim from free \, or explicit takeover from legacy.;
#X text 30 710 Use one slot for sequential 128/256 tests or both slots for simultaneous Grids.;
#X text 30 740 release always asks the Grid layer to darken its valid surface before /sys/port 0.;
#X text 30 770 Device menus are populated dynamically from each slot's identity-based registry.;
#X text 30 800 This patch uses live SerialOSC discovery port 12002 and does not alter SerialOSC preferences except explicit claims.;
#X text 30 830 Normalized A/B key events are mirrored to the loopback-only machine monitor on port 17910.;
